
### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Open API (json)
GET http://localhost:8081/docs
Content-Type: application/json

### Open API (yml)
GET http://localhost:8081/docs.yaml

### Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html

### Get Cart
GET http://localhost:8081/cart/v1/carts/100

### Create Cart
POST http://localhost:8081/cart/v1/carts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"tcin" : "123456", "quantity": 12},
  {"tcin" : "789123", "quantity": 12}
]

### Remove Item from Cart (The T-Shirt)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/cart/v1/carts/100/items/456788

### Add Item to Cart (The T-Shirt)
POST http://localhost:8081/cart/v1/carts/100/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"tcin" : "456788", "quantity": 2}

### Updates item quantity in the cart
PATCH http://localhost:8081/cart/v1/carts/100/items/456788
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 3}
